@FantasyX.Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### List teams in a public league
POST {{FantasyX.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/espn/leagues/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leagueId": 123456,
  "season": 2024
}

### Import a specific team's roster
POST {{FantasyX.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/espn/team
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leagueId": 123456,
  "season": 2024,
  "teamId": 1
}

###
